## Why This Is Asked
Introduces real-world API auth lifecycle basics and common beginner pitfalls: token expiry, refresh, revocation, and multi-tenant isolation.

## Key Concepts
- OAuth 2.0 token flows (client_credentials, refresh)
- Token expiry handling and refresh race conditions
- Per-tenant data access and scope validation

